杜恩加尔，只是诸多批次版本中择选出下次迭代的模板？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C157E70209165AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1421353017:1":{"text":"正是。这个命名方式能够证明的是……","source_cn":"正是。这个命名方式能够证明的是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A7CA7F128D35E15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1421353018:1":{"text":"伊娜，你所向往的钢心帝国，并不是充斥着传统与诗歌的古老国度。","source_cn":"伊娜，你所向往的钢心帝国，并不是充斥着传统与诗歌的古老国度。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09A5DC31300B103C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1421353019:1":{"text":"甚至在帝国覆灭前夕，无所不精的多面手工程师也在慢慢退出舞台。","source_cn":"甚至在帝国覆灭前夕，无所不精的多面手工程师也在慢慢退出舞台。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0F22E15DF21081E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1421353020:1":{"text":"在神明临世，帝国长存的古老年代，矮人们就已经开始尝试分工化、专业化、流程化和工厂化。","source_cn":"在神明临世，帝国长存的古老年代，矮人们就已经开始尝试分...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x601CCBF527937902","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1421353021:1":{"text":"并且探索着，能够批量生产所谓神器，连神力与魔力都为机械所驾驭的——矮人自己的道路。","source_cn":"并且探索着，能够批量生产所谓神器，连神力与魔力都为机械...","status":"matched","hash_x